48.webm?t=1714668872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1804820/extras/1ea22aac9af942827a4f5f9edf26b348.mp4?t=1714668872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br></li><li>Interact with the environment in order to trigger events.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1804820/extras/f7488493a6f2164f67ae9a98d2823752.poster.avif?t=1714668872\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1804820/extras/f7488493a6f2164f67ae9a98d2823752.webm?t=1714668872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1804820/extras/f7488493a6f2164f67ae9a98d2823752.mp4?t=1714668872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br></li><li>Levels with mutiple lines where you have to move the lines such that the ball will bounce from one to another in order to move through areas that are inaccessible to either one of the lines.<br></li><li>Levels which have no magic ball. In these level you have to rely solely on your line to navigate the level however you may interact with other objects in order to reach the portal at the end.<br></li><li>Areas in which the line cannot move through but the ball can, so the ball needs to be thrown and reach another line or deactivate the line blocking zone in order to progress in the level.</li></ul>",
